3GPP TSG-RAN3 Meeting #112-e R3-211428 Electronic meeting, 17 - 27 May 2021 3GPP TSG-RAN2 Meeting #113-e R2-2102493 electronic meeting, online, 25th Jan - 5th Feb 2020 Title: LS on signalling SN initiated release of SCG Response to: Release: Rel 15 Work Item: NR_newRAT-Core Source: 3GPP RAN2 To: 3GPP RAN3 Cc: Contact Person: Name: Himke van der Velde E-mail Address: himke.vandervelde@samsung.com Send any reply LS to: 3GPP Liaisons Coordinator, mailto:3GPPLiaison@etsi.org Attachments: 1. Overall description: RAN2 discussed the case in which SN wants to initiate release of the SCG resources while DRBs may still remain SN terminated (i.e., an SCG release request initiated by the SN). RAN2 would like to check with RAN3 whether, in current X2/Xn signaling, it is supported for the SN to indicate such SCG release request to the MN. 2. Actions: To 3GPP RAN3 ACTION: RAN2 respectfully asks RAN3 to clarify whether, in current X2/Xn signaling, SN can indicate SCG release request to the MN. 3. Date of next TSG RAN WG2 meetings: RAN2#113-bis-e 12th April – 20th April 2021 Online RAN2#114-e 19th May – 27th May 2021 Online

