3GPP TSG-RAN3 Meeting #105 R3-193317 Ljubljana, Slovenia, 26-30 August 2019 3GPP TSG RAN WG2#106 R2-1908487 Reno, Nevada, USA, 13 – 17 May, 2019 Title: Reply LS on PDCCH monitoring for NR-DC Response to: R1-1905689/ R2-1905509 Release: Rel-15 Work Item: NR_newRAT-Core Source: RAN WG2 To: RAN WG1 CC: RAN WG3 Contact Person: Name: Himke van der Velde E-mail Address: himke.vandervelde@samsung.com Attachments: R2-1908377 (38.331), and R2-1906822 (38.306) 1. Overall Description: RAN2 would like thank RAN1 for the LS on PDCCH monitoring for NR-DC. RAN2 agreed to introduce to the configuration, capability and inter-node parameters as requested by RAN1, see the attached CRs. RAN2 would like to point out that both for the configuration and the capabilities, a reference to RAN1 specifications was added rather than specifying the constraints that apply regarding the setting of these fields. 2. Actions: To RAN WG2 ACTION: RAN2 kindly asks RAN1 to take the above into consideration, in particular that RAN2 assumes that RAN1 will specify the constraints that apply regarding the setting of configuration and UE capability parameters. 3. Date of Next RAN WG1 Meetings: RAN2 Meeting #107 26 Aug – 30 Aug Prague, CZ RAN2 Meeting #107bis 14 Oct – 18 Oct China

